<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	   C/S =  ----			C/S =  2.55 %</p>
<p>	   O/N =  ----			O/N =  ----</p>
<p>	   T/N =  5.10 %		    T/N =  ----</p>
<p>		   May 26, 1997		     May 23, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  3.06 %     1 month forward =  3.40 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  3.57 %     2 month forward =  3.91 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  4.20 %     3 month forward =  4.42 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  4.59 %     4 month forward =  4.76 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  4.90 %     5 month forward =  4.97 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  4.75 %     6 month forward =  4.87 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
